                                                "sense_id": "a6cea0ee-c003-3f8c-bafb-2be39c6491a6",
                                                "text": "Inthronization, in ancient times, immediately succeeded the rite of consecration; the new bishop being honourably placed in his episcopal chair by the prelates assembled for his consecration."
